	(text "nRF54L10-QFAA, Nordic reference config 1 (internal DC/DC). 2.4 GHz match per Nordic ref v0.8;\nC211 ground to VSS_PA only; C212 ground to bottom layer only; inner planes cut out under the match.\nUART_TX/RX = UARTE20 on P1.13/P1.14. GNSS_EN on P2.00. SWD + SWO + nRESET to internal test pads."
